- FastAPI + Uvicorn, Pydantic v2, pydantic-settings
- SQLAlchemy 2.0 (async, `AsyncSession`) + asyncpg, PostgreSQL 16
- Alembic (migrations)
- Passwords: `bcrypt` package directly (do not use passlib)
- Lint/format: ruff. Types: mypy --strict. Layering: import-linter.
- Tests: pytest, pytest-asyncio, httpx (AsyncClient), testcontainers-python (PostgreSQL,
  NEVER SQLite/H2 or mocked DB for integration tests)
