GET /api/player-seasons (?seasonId= &position= &search= &page=), GET /api/player-seasons/{id}
PATCH /api/admin/player-seasons/{id} (ADMIN update salary {salary: int >= 1}, rejected with POOL_LOCKED if draft active)
POST /api/admin/players/import (multipart CSV, rejected with POOL_LOCKED if draft active), see IMPORT below
POST /api/tournaments/{id}/draft/start (requires READY status, pool validation, resets teams.budget_used = 0)
GET /api/drafts/{id}; GET /api/drafts/{id}/picks
